                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="caveat">
                <b>⚠</b>
                <div>
                    <b>These numbers are relative.</b> They are not absolute performance
                    figures; they only show how the three modes compare with each other.
                    Use them to see which mode is cheaper and which is more expensive, not
                    to predict what any of them will cost in your own application.
                </div>
